  /* ⚠️ The scope line used to be its own parchment band; the client moved it to the FOOT of §7 —
     *"不要单开一个不同的背景，很突兀"*. It now shares §7's ivory ground and has no background of its
     own. `.cr-scope-k` survives as its inline brass label. */
  .cr-back-scope { margin: clamp(1.8rem, 3.6vw, 2.4rem) 0 0; padding-top: 1.1rem; border-top: 1px solid rgba(31, 59, 44, 0.14); font-size: 0.94rem; line-height: 1.62; color: var(--color-brand-muted); max-width: 92ch; }
